{"chunk_id": "e928b8f6-c1fa-4723-b5e2-2f1659b36bf5", "doc_id": "09-final-summary", "text": "## 5. 从治理视角的结论\n\n如果要把这个项目用于隐私敏感场景，最有效的不是“只关 telemetry”，而是：\n\n- 控制输入上下文\n- 关闭 transcript persistence\n- 关闭 auto memory / team memory\n- 禁用非必要网络\n- 不启用 remote / bridge / transcript share", "chunker_name": "structural", "source_type": "github_md", "level": 1, "parent_id": null, "is_parent": true, "structure_type": "section", "block_types": [], "index_role": "main", "heading_path": "第十八章：总结结论 > 5. 从治理视角的结论", "metadata": {"n_blocks": 3}, "char_len": 178}
